{{cit|uc|a+}}

== Effects ==
* Turns all [[pickup]]s, [[trinkets]] and [[chest]]s in the room into {{e|Penny|text=coins}}.
* {{dlc|r}} All non-boss enemies in the room are also transformed into coins.

== Notes ==
* Any unlocked coin variant can appear.
* {{dlc|r}} On-kill effects such as {{i|Charm of the Vampire}}, do not trigger from turning enemies into coins.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Friendly]] enemies will be transformed into coins.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.
* {{i|Blood Puppy|nr+}}: Using an Ace card on an angry Blood Puppy will create the respective pickup and tame it.

